sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent Agent
    participant Proxy as Delegation Proxy
    participant Host as Host Process
    participant Sub as Sub-Agent

    Note over Parent,Sub: Max depth: 3 · Max concurrent: 6

    Parent->>Proxy: search("web research")
    Proxy->>Host: forward
    Host-->>Parent: agent list

    Parent->>Proxy: run_agent(url)
    Proxy->>Host: spawn request
    Host->>Sub: create sandbox + proxy
    Sub-->>Host: ready
    Host-->>Parent: session_id

    Parent->>Proxy: message(id, task)
    Proxy->>Host: forward
    Host->>Sub: NDJSON message
    Sub-->>Host: response
    Host-->>Parent: result

    Parent->>Proxy: stop(id)
    Proxy->>Host: shutdown
    Host->>Sub: shutdown
    Note over Sub: VM destroyed

    Note over Parent,Sub: Each sub-agent runs in its own<br/>isolated VM with its own keys
